Subject: [PATCH 1/2] fix(3d): name tool clearance in empty pocket refusals

Distinguish nonempty targets erased by tool clearance from model-filled levels.
Pin plain and offset-shell refusals with zero and nonzero stock allowance.

Co-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>

Fixes #1709
